  46:../src/serial_sm.c **** /*
  47:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | Packet Structure (latest) from ICD |
  48:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | SYNC FRAME (0x1ACFFC1D) - 4 bytes  |
  49:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | OPCODE  (Function)      - 1 byte   |
  50:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | Error (in reply)        - 1 byte   |
  51:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | Seq Number              - 1 byte   |
  52:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | Data Length (bytes)       1 byte   |
  53:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | Reserved                - 8 bytes  |
  54:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | Data Payload            - variable |
  55:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * | CRC                     - 4 bytes  |
  56:../src/serial_sm.c ****  *
  57:../src/serial_sm.c ****  * Notes: CRC is calculated over all bytes except sync frame
  58:../src/serial_sm.c ****  *        Transmission order eg, header: 0x1A, 0xCF, 0xFC, 0x1D
  59:../src/serial_sm.c ****  *
  60:../src/serial_sm.c ****  */
